# =====================================================
# Copy the entire file from the repository to backend/priority_channel_queue.py
# This file implements the priority queue for channel processing (UI only in this patch).

# FILE 3: backend/stream_check_utils.py (MODIFICATIONS)
# ======================================================
# The following changes were made to stream_check_utils.py:
#
# 1. Early Exit Implementation in get_stream_info_and_bitrate():
#    - Added enable_early_exit parameter (default: True)
#    - Changed from subprocess.run() to subprocess.Popen() for real-time parsing
#    - Added required_data tracking (video_codec, resolution, fps, bitrate)
#    - Terminates FFmpeg when all data collected + min 3s elapsed
#    - Returns early_exit flag in result dict
#
# 2. Metadata Cache Integration in analyze_stream():
#    - Added use_cache parameter (default: True)
#    - Checks cache before FFmpeg analysis
#    - Returns cached data instantly with cached: True flag
#    - Caches successful results after analysis
#    - Logs: "💾 Using cached metadata for {stream_name}"
#
# 3. Resolution Parsing Fix (ROBUSTNESS IMPROVEMENT):
#    - OLD: res_match = re.search(r'(\d{2,5})x(\d{2,5})', line)
#    - NEW: res_match = re.search(r'(\d{2,5})\s*[x*×]\s*(\d{2,5})', line)
#    - Now supports: 1920x1080, 1920 x 1080, 1920*1080, 1920×1080
#    - Fixes issue where resolution was not detected (0x0)
#
# 4. Improved Early Exit Logging:
#    - Shows collected data: codec, resolution, fps, bitrate
#    - Debug logging for missing data when Early Exit doesn't trigger
#    - Helps diagnose why streams take long to analyze
#
# SPECIFIC CHANGES:
# - Line ~200: Added enable_early_exit parameter to get_stream_info_and_bitrate()
# - Line ~300: Replaced subprocess.run() with subprocess.Popen() for real-time parsing
# - Line ~320: Added required_data tracking dict
# - Line ~350: Added Early Exit check logic
# - Line ~426: FIXED resolution regex (Early Exit mode)
# - Line ~477: Improved Early Exit logging with collected data
# - Line ~493: Added debug logging for missing data
